{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten world, memories await to be reclaimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Draw</strong> is a 2D puzzle-platformer that blends the non-linear exploration of <strong>Metroidvania</strong> with creative puzzle-solving. Players will seek out mysterious brushes scattered across the land, unlocking unique abilities that let them dive deeper into hidden memories and piece together fragments of a lost childhood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Unlocking:</strong> Discover brushes of different colors throughout the map to gradually open new areas and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brush Powers:</strong> Each brush holds unique abilities, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue Dynamic Brush:</strong> Trace moving paths to create new routes forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/dac3f0db3c20862a3b65711d8d1bd5a7.poster.avif?t=1773137298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/dac3f0db3c20862a3b65711d8d1bd5a7.webm?t=1773137298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/dac3f0db3c20862a3b65711d8d1bd5a7.mp4?t=1773137298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orange Bounce Brush:</strong> Turn the world into a springy puzzle workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/5902d21eb89daf00d246d512f0172101.poster.avif?t=1773137298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/5902d21eb89daf00d246d512f0172101.webm?t=1773137298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/5902d21eb89daf00d246d512f0172101.mp4?t=1773137298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green Anti-Gravity Brush:</strong> Defy common sense and flip space upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/c7c7b4e646585842d9071c0b5c5d9d7f.poster.avif?t=1773137298\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/c7c7b4e646585842d9071c0b5c5d9d7f.webm?t=1773137298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071230/extras/c7c7b4e646585842d9071c0b5c5d9d7f.mp4?t=1773137298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and many more brushes waiting to be found.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Exploration:</strong> Non-linear level design allows you to explore at your own pace in any order you choose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Text:</strong> Enjoy the game without any language barrier.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>70+ hand-crafted levels</strong>, challenging both your creativity and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless blend of <strong>action and puzzle-solving</strong>, where every scene is a unique puzzle stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly atmospheric hand-drawn art style paired with immersive music, drawing you into a journey of self-discovery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f <strong>Wield the brush, reclaim your memories.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>15 scattered memory fragments</strong> to fill the void of forgetfulness.<br>Pick up the brush and unlock the path to the depths of memory.<br>Will you be able to complete this personal journey of exploration?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Line Paint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/6da2825b0da609212272eeacd597fdbde4036568.jpg"},{"name":"Bounce Paint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/0c856c483e3e16b2d6a54a579f208ca5a59ce2ba.jpg"},{"name":"Gavity Paint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/5d25e6e628b8d719dece304f14557c3e25765c33.jpg"},{"name":"Static Paint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/60979e45aa9b26882c136224f86e19bf712348c4.jpg"},{"name":"Attack Paint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/11d8f352c1684cf964dd3806f0c2537d941449a7.jpg"},{"name":"Start of Memory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/072a2d92d7c88967e4dd2040dcc90e4f611d7b8b.jpg"},{"name":"Half of Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/fd8d1bd6fa9d9e9e70a238805560e2dbd57633f8.jpg"},{"name":"Childhood Recovered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/b7a29544f499c9485fe51db67287b65716fbbc49.jpg"},{"name":"Returner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4071230/27ee3a703e9ae1c49b5b77eb7e5ffc88bbaef8e6.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Scratcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/